  "description_short": "The Keene Family YMCA runs weekly summer day camps: Camp Wakonda, a general day camp with a new theme each week, plus specialty weeks for gymnastics, adventure trips, sports, art and STEAM, some of them half days. Leadership programs serve grades 6-12. In 2026 the Y said final camp locations would be shared before camp.",
