  "refund_policy_summary": "A $25 per week deposit and a $20 registration fee per child are due at registration; the balance is charged 14 days before camp. Refunds, less the deposit, only for cancellations more than 30 days before camp; none for not attending, with medical exceptions considered. Changing camps or weeks costs $10 and can be done up to 14 days before camp.",
  "special_needs_notes": "Families of children with special needs or who need accommodations should contact the relevant Camp Director before registering.",
  "swim_waterfront_notes": "Gymnastics, Obstacle and Sports camps include time in the Y pool. Adventure Camp may visit local beaches. Swim supervision and swim tests are not described.",
